      "title": "feat: op-reth historical proof tutorial",
      "author": "dhyaniarun1993",
      "number": 1949,
      "body": "This PR introduces comprehensive documentation for running op-reth with the historical proofs Execution Extension (ExEx), specifically for the op-rs/op-reth fork.\r\n\r\n\r\nCloses [#1894](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/docs/issues/1894)\r\n\r\nBlocked on [#1942](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/docs/pull/1942)\r\n",
