    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIwiaM68uyuS",
      "title": "feat: op-reth and historical proof reference added",
      "author": "dhyaniarun1993",
      "number": 1942,
      "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\nThis PR adds comprehensive configuration reference documentation for `op-reth` and the `op-rs` fork supporting historical proofs.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n- **New Page**: `node-operators/reference/op-reth-config.mdx`\r\n  - Created a complete reference guide for `op-reth` command-line flags (General, Networking, RPC, TxPool, Debug, Database, etc.) matching the output of `op-reth node --help`.\r\n  - Added specific sections for \"Static Files\" and \"Rollup\".\r\n- **New Page**: `node-operators/reference/op-reth-historical-proof-config.mdx`\r\n  - Created a reference guide for the `op-rs/op-reth` fork specific functionality.\r\n  - Documented `proofs-history` flags.\r\n  - Added a \"Management Commands\" section documenting `op-reth proofs init`, `prune`, and `unwind`.\r\n\r\n- **Updated**: `node-operators/guides/configuration/execution-clients.mdx`\r\n  - Updated the \"op-reth\" tab to link to the new configuration reference page.\r\n  - Added a link to the historical proof configuration for users running the `op-rs` fork.\r\n- **Updated**: `mint.json`\r\n  - Registered the new pages in the navigation sidebar under **Node Operators > Reference**.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/op-rs/op-reth/issues/441",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/docs",
      "createdAt": "2026-01-12T15:48:33Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 1916,
      "deletions": 0
